# Playwright global-setup も try-catch

```js
try {
    await context.tracing.start({ screenshots: true, snapshots: true })
    // ...
} catch (error) {
    await context.tracing.stop({
      path: './playwright-report/trace/failed-setup-trace.zip',
    })
    await browser.close()
    throw error
  }

```
